    --- @deprecated You should be using Entity:GetNW2String instead.
    @side(shared)
    function GetNetworked2String(key: string, fallback: any | nil): any
    --- Retrieves a networked value at specified index on the entity that is set by `Entity:SetNetworked2Var`.
    --- @param key The key that is associated with the value
    --- @param fallback The value to return if we failed to retrieve the value. (If it isn't set)
