    --- @deprecated You should be using Entity:GetNW2Var instead.
    @side(shared)
    function GetNetworked2Var(key: string, fallback: any | nil): any
    --- Returns callback function for given NWVar of this entity. Alias of `Entity:GetNW2VarProxy`
