    --- @param key The key that is associated with the value
    --- @param fallback The value to return if we failed to retrieve the value. ( If it isn't set )
    --- @return number The retrieved value
    --- @deprecated You should use Entity:GetNWFloat instead.
    @side(shared)
    function GetNetworkedFloat(key: string, fallback: number | nil): number
    --- Retrieves a networked integer value at specified index on the entity that is set by `Entity:SetNetworkedInt`.
    --- @param key The key that is associated with the value
    --- @param fallback The value to return if we failed to retrieve the value. ( If it isn't set )
    --- @return number The retrieved value
