    @side(client)
    function GetSurfaceColor(startPos: Vector, endPos: Vector): Vector
    --- Returns a vector representing linear tone mapping scale. See `render.SetToneMappingScaleLinear` for details.
    --- @return Vector The tonemapping scales. * X - Output scale. * Y - Lightmap scale. * Z - Reflection map scale.
