    @side(client)
    function RedownloadAllLightmaps(DoStaticProps: boolean | nil, UpdateStaticLighting: boolean | nil): nil
    --- Renders additive flashlights on an `IMesh`, a direct replacement for `render.PushFlashlightMode`.
