--- * "_pst"
--- * "_shd"
--- * "_ss"
--- * "_posture"
--- * "_anm"
--- * "ghostanim"
--- * "_paths"
--- * "_shared"
--- * "anim_"
--- * "gestures_"
--- * "shared_ragdoll_"
