--- HL2 - **Friendly Rollermines** - `npc_rollermine` ( Hacked )
declare CLASS_HACKED_ROLLERMINE: number
--- HL2 - **Hunters** - `npc_hunter`
declare CLASS_COMBINE_HUNTER: number
